{
  "id": "dynamic__absolute__and_kinematic_viscosity___defin",
  "title": "Dynamic, Absolute, and Kinematic Viscosity – Definitions & Conversions",
  "description": "Calculator for converting between dynamic (absolute) viscosity and kinematic viscosity. Includes conversions between Pa·s, cP, cSt, and SSU units.",
  "type": "calculator",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Viscosity Conversion Calculator\n\nViscosity is a measure of a fluid's resistance to flow. There are two related measures:\n\n- **Dynamic (Absolute) Viscosity**: A measure of internal resistance, typically expressed in Pa·s or cP\n- **Kinematic Viscosity**: The ratio of absolute viscosity to density, typically expressed in cSt or m²/s\n\n### Key Relationships:\n- ν = μ / ρ (Kinematic viscosity = Dynamic viscosity / Density)\n- 1 cP = 0.001 Pa·s\n- 1 cSt = 10⁻⁶ m²/s = 1 mm²/s"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "headers": [
        "Dynamic to Kinematic Viscosity"
      ],
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "dynamic_visc_cP",
          "label": "Dynamic Viscosity",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "cP (centiPoise)",
          "defaultValue": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "density",
          "label": "Fluid Density",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "kg/m³",
          "defaultValue": 1000
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "kinematic_visc_cSt",
          "label": "Kinematic Viscosity",
          "unit": "cSt (centiStoke)",
          "formula": "(inputs.dynamic_visc_cP / inputs.density) * 1000",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "kinematic_visc_m2s",
          "label": "Kinematic Viscosity",
          "unit": "m²/s",
          "formula": "(inputs.dynamic_visc_cP / inputs.density) * 1e-6",
          "format": "scientific"
        },
        {
          "id": "dynamic_visc_Pa_s",
          "label": "Dynamic Viscosity",
          "unit": "Pa·s",
          "formula": "inputs.dynamic_visc_cP * 0.001",
          "format": "scientific"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "headers": [
        "Kinematic to SSU Conversion"
      ],
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "kinematic_visc_cSt_input",
          "label": "Kinematic Viscosity",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "cSt (centiStoke)",
          "defaultValue": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "temperature_range",
          "label": "Temperature Range",
          "type": "select",
          "options": [
            {
              "label": "Below 100 cSt",
              "value": "low"
            },
            {
              "label": "Above 100 cSt",
              "value": "high"
            }
          ],
          "defaultValue": "low"
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "ssu_viscosity",
          "label": "Kinematic Viscosity in SSU",
          "unit": "SSU (Saybolt Universal Seconds)",
          "formula": "inputs.temperature_range === 'low' ? (0.226 * inputs.kinematic_visc_cSt_input + 195 / inputs.kinematic_visc_cSt_input) : (0.220 * inputs.kinematic_visc_cSt_input + 135 / inputs.kinematic_visc_cSt_input)",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
